pe/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-30dfc837-d5c1-5761-8aca-09d8e183f2c6" :answer-field/choices ["answer-30dfc837-d5c1-5761-8aca-09d8e183f2c6"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-30dfc837-d5c1-5761-8aca-09d8e183f2c6" :answer/id #uuid "30dfc837-d5c1-5761-8aca-09d8e183f2c6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-ed1928c0-77ed-571b-8c4d-3959f2119041" :question/id #uuid "ed1928c0-77ed-571b-8c4d-3959f2119041" :question/math-academy-id "q-123288" :question/problem "Find $|r(1)|$ given that $r(t)=⟨8{t}^{2}-5,\\,2t+2,\\,5t⟩.$" :question/worked-solution "Evaluating the function at $t=1,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r(1) & =⟨8({1}^{2})-5,\\,2(1)+2,\\,5(1)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨3,\\,4,\\,5⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the magnitude of this vector, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|r(1)| & =\\sqrt{{(3)}^{2}+{(4)}^{2}+(5)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{9+16+25} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{50} \\\\  & =5\\sqrt{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-03372984-3b6a-52fd-b939-f99920dffdff"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-03372984-3b6a-52fd-b939-f99920dffdff" :answer-field/id #uuid "03372984-3b6a-52fd-b939-f99920dffdff" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-31837ee6-10ca-577f-944f-bdb787e80bd6" :answer-field/choices ["answer-9200df3f-c132-5c9d-b7e0-d5ed27923967" "answer-b7701537-72c1-5510-bb99-fa0372ec42ec" "answer-637850e7-5b69-5e11-8f07-9bcea38d6888" "answer-31837ee6-10ca-577f-944f-bdb787e80bd6" "answer-988fc287-3433-562c-bd45-9cb784417c65"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9200df3f-c132-5c9d-b7e0-d5ed27923967" :answer/id #uuid "9200df3f-c132-5c9d-b7e0-d5ed27923967" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b7701537-72c1-5510-bb99-fa0372ec42ec" :answer/id #uuid "b7701537-72c1-5510-bb99-fa0372ec42ec"