-a439-fc5376186768" :question/math-academy-id "q-348638"] ["question-a52558c8-d1b8-5f58-a439-fc5376186768" :question/problem "Given that $r(t)=⟨{t}^{2}-4,\\,\\sqrt{3t+7}⟩,$ calculate $r(5).$ Do not round the answer.\n\n$r(5)=⟨$\n{{field-1}} $,$\n\n{{field-2}}$⟩$"] ["question-a52558c8-d1b8-5f58-a439-fc5376186768" :question/worked-solution "We substitute $t=5$ into our function, and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r(5) & =⟨{5}^{2}-4,\\,\\sqrt{3\\cdot 5+7}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨21,\\,\\sqrt{22}⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-a52558c8-d1b8-5f58-a439-fc5376186768" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-e0f8d604-f325-5c36-a83b-915ff5c554ba" :answer-field/id #uuid "e0f8d604-f325-5c36-a83b-915ff5c554ba"] ["answer-87bfc9d6-7188-5f19-9be2-32c52f0d153f" :answer/id #uuid "87bfc9d6-7188-5f19-9be2-32c52f0d153f"] ["answer-87bfc9d6-7188-5f19-9be2-32c52f0d153f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-87bfc9d6-7188-5f19-9be2-32c52f0d153f" :answer/value "21"] ["answer-field-e0f8d604-f325-5c36-a83b-915ff5c554ba" :answer-field/key "field-1"] ["answer-field-e0f8d604-f325-5c36-a83b-915ff5c554ba" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-e0f8d604-f325-5c36-a83b-915ff5c554ba" :answer-field/correct "answer-87bfc9d6-7188-5f19-9be2-32c52f0d153f"] ["answer-field-e0f8d604-f325-5c36-a83b-915ff5c554ba" :answer-field/choices "answer-87bfc9d6-7188-5f19-9be2-32c52f0d153f"] ["answer-field-c924a8a3-dc61-57d1-8c62-8746f205215f" :answer-field/id #uuid "c924a8a3-dc61-57d1-8c62-8746f205215f"] ["answer-f0c61ea1-4333-5b13-9cb7-3582d2854949" :answer/id #uuid "f0c61ea1-4333-5b13-9cb7-3582d2854949"] ["answer-f0c61ea1-4333-5b13-9cb7-3582d2854949" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-f0c61ea1-4333-5b13-9cb7-3582d2854949" :answer/value "\\sqrt{22}"] ["answer-field-c924a8a3-dc61-57d1-8c62-8746f205215f" :answer-field/key "field-2"] ["answer-field-c924a8a3-dc61-57d1-8c62-8746f205215f" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-c924a8a3-dc61-57d1-8c62-8746f205215f" 